<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f3f4f6;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="background: #2e8b57; padding: 24px 20px; text-align: center; color: white;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px;">Now in stock</h1>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 32px 28px; color: #4a5568; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
            <p>Hi there,</p>
            <p>You asked us to let you know when <strong>{{productName}}</strong> became available. It's now in stock.</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
                <a href="{{productUrl}}" style="background: #2e8b57; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; display: inline-block;">View product</a>
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #718096;">This is a one-time email. We won't send another alert for this product unless you sign up again.</p>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #718096;">
                Customer Services<br />
                Email us: customerservices@vapehub.co.uk<br />
                Call us: 07508 373773
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #a0aec0;">© {{currentYear}} Vapehub. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
